{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 1, :comments ["<b>And he returned</b> — because he said: \"and he awakened me,\" and he was asleep." "And the meaning of <b>was awakened</b> — and not awakened by means of another, but rather by himself; discreetly, as though he was awakened by himself."], :book :zechariah, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 4, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Zecharia -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/zecharya"] ["1" "http://www.daat.ac.il/daat/olam_hatanah/mefaresh.asp?book=25&perek=5&mefaresh=ezra"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:45:51.868646613Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}